<area shape="poly" id="edge135" href="https://www.row2k.com/results/resultspage.cfm?UID=6F7CED5A9E3FC80A9EBD370AFF530DB2&amp;cat=5" title="NEIRA Boys &amp; Girls Fours,St. Marks, Nobles, Notre Dame, NCDS, Hopkins, Hotchkiss			
Distance: 1500m Conditions: Fabulous racing conditions. Great water with a 5mph quartering tail. No change in wind all afternoon. Comments: Thanks to all crews for a great day of racing on a perfect Lake Quinsigamond day!
None" alt="" coords="3301,1442,2887,1545,2593,1608,2290,1664,2090,1690,1922,1705,1921,1700,2089,1685,2289,1659,2592,1603,2886,1540,3296,1443"/>
