Distance: 1350 Conditions: Great conditions overall. Flat water with a slight crosswind. In the 3rd boat race the wind direction shifted to be more of a headwind, but shifted back for the 2nd and 1st boat races. Order of races was 4&#45;3&#45;2&#45;1. Comments: Belmont Hill School wins the Ducey Cup by winning the first boat race. In the 3rd boat race, Belmont Hill steered off course significantly near the finish line. It did not impact order of finish.
