<area shape="poly" id="edge84" href="https://www.row2k.com/results/resultspage.cfm?UID=90621A35084DD4A81C8811CF573DE6CD&amp;cat=1" title="NEIRA Boys Fours, Pomfret v. Dexter&#45;Southfield, Groton, Taft			
Distance: 1500M Conditions: Very light tailwind, 3 to 6 MPH. Water: flat or slight ripple. Great conditions. Comments: Note: Pomfret raced down; Pomfret results should not be considered for NEIRA Seeding.
Races alternated with girls. Order of boys races: B4, B2, B3, B1, B5. 
In the B2 event, D&#45;S drifted slightly into Taft&#39;s lane, and Taft drifted slightly into Groton&#39;s lane during the first 500. No boat appeared to be impeded; no blades touched. No protest registered.
Great conditions, some close racing. Thanks to D&#45;S, Groton, and Taft for making the trip.
