Distance: 1500 Conditions: Steady tailwind from 500m on throughout the day; clean water. Comments: Girls 2V event timing malfunction lead to incomplete timing results for that race. Ms. Porter&#39;s finished comfortably (5+ lengths open water) ahead of Lyme/Old Lyme; Lyme/Old Lyme likewise finished comfortably (5+ lengths open water) ahead of Canterbury.
