Distance: 1500M Conditions: 9 MPH tailwind, occasional gusts of ~16 MPH. Light chop, more prevalent in the second 750. Comments: Pomfret Boys raced down. Pomfret racing should not be used for NEIRA seeding.
Alternated races with Girls. Order of boys&#39; races: B3, B2, B1, B4/Novice.
*Not sure why/how Middletown B4 was so much faster than B2, B3 &#45; conditions were similar.
Thank you, Berkshire and Middletown, for making the trip.
